    {
      "text": "Due to the danger that this synthetic Pokémon may go on a rampage, it wears a control mask to restrain its power.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pokémon weapon developed for a specific mission, it went berserk during an experiment, so it was cryogenically frozen.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "There’s danger of its going on a rampage, so its true power is sealed away beneath its control mask.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rumor has it that the theft of top-secret research notes led to a new instance of this Pokémon being created in the Galar region.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was modeled after a mighty Pokémon of myth. The mask placed upon it limits its power in order to keep it under control.",
